+```js
+const card = document.querySelector('coffee-card');
+card.price = 5;
+card.disabled = true;
+card.setAttribute('name', 'Maple Oat Latte');
+```
+
+The constructor creates internal markup once. Connecting replays properties set
+before registration, attaches the click handler, and renders current state.
+Disconnecting removes the handler, so instances can safely be removed and reused.
+
+Run `pnpm install` and `pnpm test` for the automated DOM tests. No build is required.
