+| `cold-brew-*.webp` | https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461023058943-07fcbe16d735 |
+
+The hero is eager and high priority for LCP. Card images and the promo image
+inside the initially closed native disclosure are lazy and low priority. Browsers
+choose when lazy images enter the loading threshold; this is not a strict promise
+that every card request waits until scrolling.
