+# Daily Grind
+
+Run `npm start` to serve the homepage using Node.js 20 or newer. `PORT` defaults to 11222.
+`npm run build` checks JavaScript syntax without starting the server.
+
+Newsletter submissions are posted to `/api/newsletter` and appended to
+`data/newsletter.jsonl`. Set `NEWSLETTER_FILE` to an absolute path on a persistent
+volume when deploying. The server serves only the homepage, stylesheet, and script;
+the signup file is private. This collects signups; newsletter delivery is managed
+separately.
+
+The server sends a Content Security Policy on every response. Only local scripts
+and styles can load, images can load from this origin and `images.unsplash.com`,
+and fetch, XHR, WebSocket, and beacon connections are restricted to this origin.
+Forms can submit only to this origin. Inline scripts, embedded frames, plugins,
+and base URL overrides are blocked. Deploy through this Node server so the policy
+header is applied; opening the HTML directly does not provide these protections.
