+<body>
+<header><a class="brand" href="./" aria-label="Fontform home"><span class="brand-mark">ff</span>fontform<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#playground" class="active">Playground</a><a href="#about" id="about-link">About the property <span aria-hidden="true" style="margin-left:5px">↗</span></a></nav><span class="version">CSS, in good shape.</span></header>
+<main id="playground">
+<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">SMALL PROPERTY. BIG DIFFERENCE.</p><h1>A little harmony <em>for your type.</em></h1><p class="subtitle">Different fonts. Same visual rhythm. Explore the quiet power of font-size-adjust.</p></div><div class="live"><i></i> Interactive playground</div></section>
+<div class="workspace">
+<aside><div class="panel controls"><div class="controls-heading"><span class="section-label">THE CONTROLS</span><span class="tune" aria-hidden="true">☷</span></div>
